[110.637289, "o", "=== COMPREHENSIVE VERIFICATION ===\r\n\r\n1. BUDGET BY DIRECTORATE - All recovered values:\r\n   K5 (2016 Total):  19285\r\n   F8 (2019 Space Ops):  4639\r\n   B9 (2020 Science):  7139\r\n   E10 (2021 Exploration):  4709\r\n   K10 (2021 Total):  21439\r\n   C12 (2023 Aeronautics):  936\r\n\r\n   K5 verification: sum=19285, stored=19285, match=True\r\n   K10 verification: sum=21439, stored=21439, match=True\r\n\r\n2. YoY CHANGES (%) - All recovered values:\r\n   D7 (2019 Space Tech %):  10.79\r\n   B9 (2021 Science %):  2.27\r\n   F9 (2021 Space Ops %):  -0.08\r\n\r\n   D7 verification: calculated=10.79, stored=10.79\r\n   B9 verification: calculated=2.27, stored=2.27\r\n   F9 verification: calculated=-0.08, stored=-0.08\r\n\r\n3. DIRECTORATE SHARES (%) - All recovered values:\r\n   F5 (2016 Space Ops %):  26.08\r\n   B10 (2021 Science %):  43.64\r\n\r\n   F5 verification: calculated=26.08, stored=26.08\r\n   B10 verification: calculated=34.05, stored=43.64\r\n\r\n4. GROWTH ANALYSIS - All recovered values:\r\n   E5 (FY2019 Exploration):  5047\r\n   E4 (Exploration CAGR %):  8.58\r\n   B7 (Science 5-Yr Change):  1534\r\n   B8 (Science Avg Annual):  7610.3\r\n\r\n   E4 verification: calculated=8.58, stored=8.58\r\n   B7 verification: calculated=1534, stored=1534\r\n   B8 verification: calculated=7610.3, stored=7610.3\r\n\r\n=== ALL VERIFICATIONS COMPLETE ===\r\n\r\nSummary of all recovered values:\r\n  Budget by Directorate: 6 values recovered\r\n  YoY Changes: 3 values recovered\r\n  Directorate Shares: 2 values recovered\r\n  Growth Analysis: 4 values recovered\r\n  TOTAL: 15 missing values successfully recovered\r\n"]
